  </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Hocus Pocus Movie Night</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Welcome to London’s spookiest screening of Hocus Pocus in our haunted Victorian Theatre™</strong></p><p><strong>DOOR 6:30PM / LIVE SHOW &amp; FILM 7:30PM / MOVIE ENDS: APPROX 9:30PM</strong></p><p><br>“Oh look, another glorious movie night. Makes me sick!” 🤮</p><p><br>The SistERSss are back for our annual spell binding screening of Hocus Pocus on our Monstrousy huge screen, staring your host for the evening, our Sanderson-ish Sisters 🧙🧙🧙</p><p><br>So, pop on your best witch garms, dig out a broomstick, grab your creepy crew and come get spooky with us 🎃</p><p><br>Expect:<br>The full movie uninterrupted on a massive 25ft screen 📺<br>Our Dreamteam Hosts &amp; show team 🎤<br>The Witchiest Witch Costume Comp 🥇<br>Spooky Skeleton dance-offs ☠️<br>Cauldron cocktails 🍹<br>Ooky spooky decor 🏚️<br>Haunted hotdogs &amp; nasty nachos (Vegan bad-ness too) 🌭<br>Pop corn for only £3 🍿</p><p><br>Our Movie nights are like no other, alongside watching Hocus Pocus uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before &amp; after the film, including The Grand’s Dream Team hosts &amp; show team, all the confetti, games and even the occasional balloon drop. 🎈<br>Feel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar &amp; food stalls stay open during the movie. Alas, there is no club night after this screening. It’s is a Tuesday after all… 😂</p><p><br>For any show / venue info, please contact info@claphamgrand.com<br>For any accessibility requirements / tickets, please contact access@claphamgrand.com</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/theclaphamgrand>The Clapham Grand </a><a href=/hashtag/screening>Screening </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a><a href=/hashtag/singalong>Singalong </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">Our Vibe\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n        <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n    </svg>\r\n            </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"music-container \" id=\"music-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"music-info\">\r\n                <h4 id=\"title\">\r\n                    <label id=\"labelSongName\">I Put a Spell on You (In the Style of Hocus Pocus) by PattyCake</label>\r\n                </h4>\r\n                <div class=\"progress-container\" id=\"progress-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <audio src='https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/8e/f9/cd/8ef9cd42-458b-babb-cd40-dfe3356b45a2/mzaf_16594187965360898265.plus.aac.p.m4a' id=\"audio\"></audio>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\r\n                <img alt=\"music-cover\" id=\"cover\" src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-96x96.png\" data-src='https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music123/v4/c0/bd/35/c0bd3562-ca1c-c00d-c0f5-42101c6cab87/859734739591_cover.jpg/110x110bb.jpg' />\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"control-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"play\" class=\"action-button action-button-big\">\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#cdc2d0\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"playbutton\" width=\"30px\" height=\"30px\" viewBox=\"0 0 163.861 163.861\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n                            <g>\r\n                                <path d=\"M34.857,3.613C20.084-4.861,8.107,2.081,8.107,19.106v125.637c0,17.042,11.977,23.975,26.75,15.509L144.67,97.275   c14.778-8.477,14.778-22.211,0-30.686L34.857,3.613z\" />\r\n                            </g>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\