erTicketTypes$ctl01$HiddenFieldDealId\" id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_RepeaterTicketTypes_0_HiddenFieldDealId_0\" value=\"145984\" />\r\n                                                <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$RepeaterTicketCategories$ctl01$RepeaterTicketTypes$ctl01$HiddenFieldDiscountId\" id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_RepeaterTicketTypes_0_HiddenFieldDiscountId_0\" />\r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\n                                                    <div class=\"bottomborder\">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ticket-group\">\r\n\r\n                                                            \r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-name\">\r\n\r\n                                                                \r\n\r\n                                                                <div class=\"ticket-name-holder\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    <span class=\"ticket-name\">\r\n                                                                         Commitment Ticket - Free but Valuable. Cancel If Plans Change\r\n                                                                            <span class=\"ticket-status\"></span>\r\n\r\n                                                                            \r\n\r\n\r\n                                                                    </span>\r\n\r\n                                                                    \r\n\r\n                                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                                                <div class='ticket-time-holder'><i class='sub-margin'><img src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/icon-clock.png' width='20px' height='20px' alt='time icon' /> 6:30 PM - 9:30 PM</i></div><span class='waiting-list'>Only 6 Tickets Left!</span>\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-price text-right\">\r\n\r\n                                                                FREE\r\n\r\n                                                                <div class=\"fees\">\r\n                                                                    Booking Fee: No fee\r\n                                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                                                \r\n\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n\r\n                                                            \r\n                                                                <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-quantity\" id=\"ticket-detail-quantity\">\r\n                                                                    <div class=\"ticket-dropdown-holder\">\r\n                                                                        <div class=\"ticket-dropdown-title-holder\">\r\n                                                                            <label for=\"ctl00_FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_ctl01_RepeaterTicketTypes_ctl01_DropDownListTicket\" class=\"ticket-dropdown-title\">Qty</label><select name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$RepeaterTicketCategories$ctl01$RepeaterTicketTypes$ctl01$DropDownListTicket\" id=\"ctl00_FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_ctl01_RepeaterTicketTypes_ctl01_DropDownListTicket\" class=\"droptickets\">\r\n\t\t\t<option selected=\"selected\" value=\"0\">0</option>\r\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\r\n\r\n\t\t</select>\r\n                                                                        </div>\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </div>\r\n                                                            \r\n\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n\r\n                                                        \r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-group\">\r\n\r\n                                                                <div class=\"ticket-detail-more\" style=\"width: 100%\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    <div class=\"border-line\"></div>\r\n\r\n                                                                    <span class=\"moreDetails\">More Details</span>\r\n\r\n                                                                    <span class=\"hideDetails\">Hide Details</span>\r\n\r\n                                                                    <div style=\"display: none;\" class=\"ticket-details\">\r\n\r\n                                                                        \r\n                                                                            <span>\r\n                                                                                <p><p><strong>This is a free ticket.</strong> While nothing in life is truly free, this event <strong>is - </strong>and we ask you to appreciate it. It costs us money to create these events, and no-shows can spoil it for everyone. If too many people don’t attend, we may be unable to keep this free and accessible format in the future.&nbsp;</p><p>To ensure fairness, we track attendance. <strong>If you miss three events without cancelling in advance, you will be unable to book our future events.</strong> Please only book if you’re certain you can attend, and if your plans change, cancel your ticket directly via OutSavvy or text us so we can offer the spot to someone else.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for helping us sustain these events for the community!&nbsp;</p></p>\r\n                                                                            </span>\r\n                                                                        \r\n\r\n                                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n\r\n                                                        \r\n\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\n                                            \r\n\r\n                                        <div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                        \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n                                        \r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    \r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            \r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"app-basket\" id=\"ticket_basket\">\r\n\r\n                                \r\n\r\n                                </tbody>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            \r\n                            <table class=\"app-basket app-basket-totals\" style=\"background-color: white;\">\r\n                                <tbody>\r\n                                    <tr class=\"borderbottom\">\r\n                                        <td data-th=\"Cards accepted\" colspan=\"3\">\r\n                                            \r\n\r\n                                            <div class=\"secure-wrapper\">\r\n    