or%20The Marginal Film Festival.&amp;body=https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\" class=\"jssocials-share-link\" title=\"Share via Email\" name=\"Share via Email\">\r\n                                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 267.037 267.037\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n                                                <g>\r\n                                                    <path style=\"fill: #fff;\" d=\"M239.083,7.513l-141.31,166l-60.918-14.567c-9.971-2.384-12.169-15.585-3.509-21.072L239.083,7.513z   \" />\r\n                                                    <path style=\"fill: #fff;\" d=\"M239.083,7.513l-52.324,242.858c-2.031,9.426-14.011,12.4-20.213,5.016l-33.533-39.915l-35.24-41.96   L239.083,7.513z\" />\r\n                                                    <g>\r\n                                                        <polygon style=\"fill: #fff;\" points=\"133.013,215.473 93.363,249.643 97.773,173.513   \" />\r\n                                                        <path style=\"fill: #22313F;\" d=\"M235.068,1.178L29.331,131.538c-14.281,9.049-10.631,30.779,5.779,34.701l54.812,13.107    l-4.047,69.862c-0.384,6.623,7.407,10.405,12.383,6.115l33.9-29.214l28.644,34.101c10.23,12.178,29.95,7.233,33.289-8.26    L246.414,9.093C247.835,2.559,240.61-2.349,235.068,1.178z M37.36,144.208l163.93-103.87    c-1.203,1.413-103.453,121.528-106.247,124.811L38.599,151.65C35.069,150.807,34.29,146.154,37.36,144.208z M101.874,232.407    l2.295-39.617l18.338,21.835L101.874,232.407z M179.427,248.791c-0.719,3.338-4.944,4.383-7.14,1.771l-64.693-77.017    L225.473,35.07L179.427,248.791z\" />\r\n                                                    </g>\r\n                                                </g>\r\n                                            </svg></a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\"> MARGINAL FILM SESSION II - TUE 28 OCT – 6:30 PM </h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>&nbsp;🗓 Tuesday 28th October, 7pm (doors 6.30pm)</strong><br><strong>📍&nbsp; LARC (62 Fieldgate St, London E1 1ES)</strong></p><p><strong>Rating</strong>: Suitable for ages 16+&nbsp;<br><strong>Duration</strong>: 1 hour 35 minutes<br>Includes a Q&amp;A session with the Festival Curator from Brazil</p><p><i>All films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This programme showcases recent Brazilian short films that bring to the screen stories often silenced by mainstream cinema. These works reflect on race, power, violence, and everyday resistance from diverse perspectives.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Programme:</strong></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p><strong>Paçoca</strong><br>Fiction, 19′ min, All ages, 2024. Directed by Marçal Vianna.</p><p>Pedrinho is elected class representative in a school election, but his victory bothers some parents, who claim that the boy bought votes in exchange for <i>paçocas</i> (a traditional Brazilian peanut sweet).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>A Vida de Jerônimo Dentro e Fora da Casca</strong> -<i> Jerônimo's Flow</i><br>Fiction, 21′ min, 10+, 2025. Directed by Andrews Nascimento.<br>Descriptive subtitles.</p><p>Jerônimo is a young man from the outskirts of Santo André. He dreams of becoming a funk MC, but his commitment to helping his father with the <i>carro do ovo</i> (a small truck that sells eggs with a loudspeaker) takes up his time, making his dream seem more and more distant. Until one day, during a slow sales period, the boy takes the microphone from the egg truck and starts improvising rhymes to boost sales</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Caluim</strong><br>Fiction, 11′ min, All ages, 2023. Directed by Marcos Alexandre.</p><p>A Black actress receives a very peculiar kind of treatment on a film set staffed entirely by a white crew.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Esta Noite Minha Alma Partirá </strong>-<i>This Night, My Soul Shall Depart</i><br>Horror, 21′ min, 12+, 2025. Directed by Igor Vasco.</p><p>On her last day of work as a housemaid, young Kumani witnesses strange events in her employers’ home. Little does she know that her fate may be at risk.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Cordão de Prata </strong>- <i>Silver String</i><br>Fiction, 23′ min, 16+, 2025. Directed by Getulio Ribeiro.</p><p>Brilhante, a contemporary <i>capitão do mato</i> (historical slave catcher in Brazil), entertains himself with his victim before delivering the coup de grâce.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Sinopse em português</strong></h2><p><br><strong>Paçoca (RJ)</strong><br>Ficção, 19′, Livre, 2024. Direção: Marçal Vianna.<br>Legenda em Português.</p><p>Pedrinho é eleito representante de turma em uma eleição em sua própria escola, mas sua vitória incomoda alguns pais, que alegam que o menino comprou voto em troca de paçocas.</p><p><strong>A Vida de Jerônimo Dentro e Fora da Casca (SP)</strong><br>Ficção, 21′, 10 anos, 2025. Direção: Andrews Nascimento.<br>Legenda Descritiva.</p><p>Jerônimo é um jovem da periferia de Santo André. Ele tem o sonho de se tornar MC de funk, mas o compromisso em ajudar o pai com o carro do ovo toma o seu tempo de uma forma que seu sonho parece ser cada vez mais distante. Até o dia em que, durante um período baixo de vendas, o garoto assume o microfone do carro do ovo e começa a improvisar rimas para potencializar as vendas.</p><p><strong>Caluim (BA)</strong><br>Ficção, 11′, Livre, 2023. Direção: Marcos Alexandre.<br>Legenda Descritiva.</p><p>Uma atriz negra recebe um tratamento bem peculiar em um set de filmagem composto por uma equipe branca.</p><p><strong>Esta Noite Minha Alma Partirá</strong> <strong>(SP)</strong><br>Terror, 21′, 12 anos, 2025. Direção: Igor Vasco.<br>Legenda em Português e Libras.</p><p>Em seu último dia de trabalho como empregada doméstica, a jovem Kumani presencia situações estranhas na casa de seus patrões. Mal sabe ela que seu destino pode estar em risco.</p><p><strong>Cordão de Prata</strong> <strong>(RJ)</strong><br>Ficção, 23′, 16 anos, 2025. Direção: Getulio Ribeiro.<br>Legenda Descritiva.</p><p>Brilhante, um capitão do mato contemporâneo, diverte-se com sua vítima antes do tiro de misericórdia…</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/festival>Festival </a><a href=/hashtag/screening>Screening </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"need-to-know\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">What You Need To Know\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                        </h4>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Age restriction: 16+\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 44px; margin-bottom: 44px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"organiser\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">Organised By\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.