       <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"Festival\",\"name\": \" MARGINAL FILM SESSION II - TUE 28 OCT – 6:30 PM \",\"startDate\": \"2025-10-28T18:30:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2025-10-28T21:45:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/06ff13f6-6237-4140-9f1f-7f70cc9512c9.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \" &#128467; Tuesday 28th October, 7pm (doors 6.30pm)&#128205;  LARC (62 Fieldgate St, London E1 1ES)Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 35 minutesIncludes a Q&amp;amp;A session with the Festival Curator from BrazilAll films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles. This programme showcases recent Brazilian short films that bring to the screen stories often silenced by mainstream cinema. These works reflect on race, power, violence, and everyday resistance from diverse perspectives. Programme: Pa&#231;ocaFiction, 19′ min, All ages, 2024. Directed by Mar&#231;al Vianna.Pedrinho is elected class representative in a school election, but his victory bothers some parents, who claim that the boy bought votes in exchange for pa&#231;ocas (a traditional Brazilian peanut sweet). A Vida de Jer&#244;nimo Dentro e Fora da Casca - Jer&#244;nimo&#39;s FlowFiction, 21′ min, 10+, 2025. Directed by Andrews Nascimento.Descriptive subtitles.Jer&#244;nimo is a young man from the outskirts of Santo Andr&#233;. He dreams of becoming a funk MC, but his commitment to helping his father with the carro do ovo (a small truck that sells eggs with a loudspeaker) takes up his time, making his dream seem more and more distant. Until one day, during a slow sales period, the boy takes the microphone from the egg truck and starts improvising rhymes to boost sales CaluimFiction, 11′ min, All ages, 2023. Directed by Marcos Alexandre.A Black actress receives a very peculiar kind of treatment on a film set staffed entirely by a white crew. Esta Noite Minha Alma Partir&#225; -This Night, My Soul Shall DepartHorror, 21′ min, 12+, 2025. Directed by Igor Vasco.On her last day of work as a housemaid, young Kumani witnesses strange events in her employers’ home. Little does she know that her fate may be at risk. Cord&#227;o de Prata - Silver StringFiction, 23′ min, 16+, 2025. Directed by Getulio Ribeiro.Brilhante, a contemporary capit&#227;o do mato (historical slave catcher in Brazil), entertains himself with his victim before delivering the coup de gr&#226;ce.  Sinopse em portugu&#234;sPa&#231;oca (RJ)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 19′, Livre, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Mar&#231;al Vianna.Legenda em Portugu&#234;s.Pedrinho &#233; eleito representante de turma em uma elei&#231;&#227;o em sua pr&#243;pria escola, mas sua vit&#243;ria incomoda alguns pais, que alegam que o menino comprou voto em troca de pa&#231;ocas.A Vida de Jer&#244;nimo Dentro e Fora da Casca (SP)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 21′, 10 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Andrews Nascimento.Legenda Descritiva.Jer&#244;nimo &#233; um jovem da periferia de Santo Andr&#233;. Ele tem o sonho de se tornar MC de funk, mas o compromisso em ajudar o pai com o carro do ovo toma o seu tempo de uma forma que seu sonho parece ser cada vez mais distante. At&#233; o dia em que, durante um per&#237;odo baixo de vendas, o garoto assume o microfone do carro do ovo e come&#231;a a improvisar rimas para potencializar as vendas.Caluim (BA)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 11′, Livre, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Marcos Alexandre.Legenda Descritiva.Uma atriz negra recebe um tratamento bem peculiar em um set de filmagem composto por uma equipe branca.Esta Noite Minha Alma Partir&#225; (SP)Terror, 21′, 12 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Igor Vasco.Legenda em Portugu&#234;s e Libras.Em seu &#250;ltimo dia de trabalho como empregada dom&#233;stica, a jovem Kumani presencia situa&#231;&#245;es estranhas na casa de seus patr&#245;es. Mal sabe ela que seu destino pode estar em risco.Cord&#227;o de Prata (RJ)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 23′, 16 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Getulio Ribeiro.Legenda Descritiva.Brilhante, um capit&#227;o do mato contempor&#226;neo, diverte-se com sua v&#237;tima antes do tiro de miseric&#243;rdia…\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"LARC\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"LARC, 62 Fieldgate Street\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E1 1ES\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.51705\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0639185\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-28T16:30:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\",\"lowPrice\":11,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-28T16:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Contribute What You Can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-05T02:14:12:12+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-05T02:14:12:12+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/BackOrder\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-27T12:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Solidarity Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\",\"price\":11,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-28T16:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:07:35:35+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/the-marginal-film-festival\", \"description\" : \"&#127916; The Marginal Film Festival - London EditionFor the first time, Brazil’s Mostra do Filme Marginal (@mostradofilmemarginal) lands in London.  Follow our London instagram here for more details.&#128197; 26 Oct - 1 Nov 2025&#128205; Evening screenings across East, Central &amp;amp; West London Each day’s event is listed below - check details &amp;amp; confirm your spot. Mostra do Filme Marginal is an initiative that aims to value and promote independent film productions. It is not competitive; it aims at integration.Our strategy is to use the project as an instrument of diffusion, reflection, encouragement, and collective organisation of the public towards a popular, authorial, and critical cinema. In this way, we open space for works that bring to the screen characters and themes marginalised by the current sociopolitical system, offering a critical gaze beyond commercial circuits.This 5th edition, Cinema of Struggle: Art of Liberation, brings this cinema of resistance into focus — and now, to London. &#127903;️ Screenings are free, with Pay What You Can and Solidarity Tickets available.Your support directly helps cover travel costs for our curator from Brazil and makes this festival possible.\", \"name\" : \"The Marginal Film Festival\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/30645/630-pm-marginal-film-session-ii';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            // Send the like to the service\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                dataType: \"json\",\r\n                success: function