             </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: The Blair Witch Project ***FROM VHS***</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Our final Horror film of the year is our much-awaited VHS presentation of elite found footage classic </strong><i><strong>The Blair Witch Project</strong></i><strong> (1999).</strong></p><p>Three film students travel to a small town in Maryland to chase a piece of local folklore, and soon vanish, leaving behind nothing but their footage.</p><p><strong>Venture deep down into the dark basement of Dalston Superstore and get lost in the woods with us.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><i>I'm afraid to close my eyes, I'm afraid to open them…</i></p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/840;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/a6a9340b-befb-4fe1-99e1-a0441aa5597e.jpg  \" width=\"1200\" height=\"840\"></figure><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1488/1080;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/95e21d52-d3e7-416a-90ec-c0b3e0c469e1.jpg  \" width=\"1488\" height=\"1080\"></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Unfortunately subtitles will not be available for this film due to the format.</strong></p><p><strong>Seating is a mixture of benches, backed chairs, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.</strong></p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/dalstonsuperstore>Dalston Superstore </a><a href=/hashtag/screening>Screening </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">Our Vibe\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n        <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n    </svg>\r\n            </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"music-container \" id=\"music-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"music-info\">\r\n                <h4 id=\"title\">\r\n                    <label id=\"labelSongName\">Thatorchia by Ethel Cain</label>\r\n                </h4>\r\n                <div class=\"progress-container\" id=\"progress-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <audio src='https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/53/24/7b/53247b06-3716-75ad-8699-ed039a816ccf/mzaf_10761886646769048064.plus.aac.p.m4a' id=\"audio\"></audio>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\r\n                <img alt=\"music-cover\" id=\"cover\" src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-96x96.png\" data-src='https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music221/v4/e1/d1/fa/e1d1faae-072c-0806-e2b1-41f06917002c/199066077030.jpg/110x110bb.jpg' />\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"control-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"play\" class=\"action-button action-button-big\">\r\n  