: \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Our final Horror film of the year is our much-awaited VHS presentation of elite found footage classic The Blair Witch Project (1999).Three film students travel to a small town in Maryland to chase a piece of local folklore, and soon vanish, leaving behind nothing but their footage.Venture deep down into the dark basement of Dalston Superstore and get lost in the woods with us. I&#39;m afraid to close my eyes, I&#39;m afraid to open them…   Unfortunately subtitles will not be available for this film due to the format.Seating is a mixture of benches, backed chairs, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Dalston Superstore\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Dalston Superstore, 117 Kingsland High Street\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E8 2PB\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.5501\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0753984\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-29T18:00:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/31119/transmissions-presents-the-blair-witch-project-from-vhs\",\"lowPrice\":5,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-22T21:44:44:44+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-22T21:44:44:44+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-29T18:00:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Entry (suggested for trans attendees)\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/31119/transmissions-presents-the-blair-witch-project-from-vhs\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-22T21:44:44:44+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-22T21:44:44:44+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"20