l be tailored to echo the film’s haunting themes, turning the interval into a living, breathing extension of Bava’s eerie universe. Come dressed for the occasion, settle into Love Affair Basement&#39;s moody setting, and get ready for a Halloween celebration like no other…if you dare &#129415; &#129344; &#128367; &#129702; &#129656;\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Devianza On Screen: Mario Bava&#39;s &quot;Black Sabbath&quot; - A Halloween Film Screening &amp; Cabaret Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/29949/devianza-on-screen-mario-bavas-black-sabbath-a-halloween-film-screening-cabaret\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/8ae7fe3b-7823-41a1-8552-e2ee51edc2cd.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Devianza On Screen: Mario Bava's \"Black Sabbath\" - A Halloween Film Screening & Cabaret Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/29949/devianza-on-screen-mario-bavas-black-sabbath-a-halloween-film-screening-cabaret\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/8ae7fe3b-7823-41a1-8552-e2ee51edc2cd.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Devianza Cabaret Presents: I Tre Volti della Paura (Black Sabbath)&#128197; October 30th&#128205; Love Affair Basement, 324 Hackney Rd, London On the eve of Halloween, Devianza Cabaret invites you to a night of cult cinema and spine-tingling cabaret performances, bringing Mario Bava’s legendary 1963 anthology “I Tre Volti della Paura” (&quot;Black Sabbath&quot;) to the silver screen. A cornerstone of Italian horror, this gothic triptych features Boris Karloff in one of his most memorable roles, weaving together three chilling tales: a supernatural stalker haunting a lonely woman, a vampiric family curse, and a nail-biting story of a phone call from a stranger. Stylish, suspenseful, and macabre, it’s a cult classic that inspired generations of filmmakers. The film will be screened in English language. To heighten the atmosphere, the film will be paired with immersive Burlesque and Drag performances. Expect glam ghouls, spooky acts, and campy homages to Bava’s surreal imagery. Each act will be tailored to echo the film’s haunting themes, turning the interval into a living, breathing extension of Bava’s eerie universe. Come dressed for the occasion, settle into Love Affair Basement&#39;s moody setting, and get ready for a Halloween celebration like no other…if you dare &#129415; &#129344; &#128367; &#129702; &#129656;\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/29949/devianza-on-screen-mario-bavas-black-sabbath-a-halloween-film-screening-cabaret\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | Devianza On Screen: Mario Bava&#39;s &quot;Black Sabbath&quot; - A Halloween Film Screening &amp; Cabaret | Thursday 30th October 2025 @ Love Affair Basement | FREE to £15 | Find event and ticket information for Devianza Cabaret\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n    