811L38.599,151.65C35.069,150.807,34.29,146.154,37.36,144.208z M101.874,232.407    l2.295-39.617l18.338,21.835L101.874,232.407z M179.427,248.791c-0.719,3.338-4.944,4.383-7.14,1.771l-64.693-77.017    L225.473,35.07L179.427,248.791z\" />\r\n                                                    </g>\r\n                                                </g>\r\n                                            </svg></a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Devianza On Screen: Mario Bava's \"Black Sabbath\" - A Halloween Film Screening & Cabaret</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Devianza Cabaret Presents: </strong><i><strong>I Tre Volti della Paura (Black Sabbath)</strong></i><br>📅 <strong>October 30th</strong><br>📍 <strong>Love Affair Basement, 324 Hackney Rd, London</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On the eve of Halloween, Devianza Cabaret invites you to a night of cult cinema and spine-tingling cabaret performances, bringing Mario Bava’s <strong>legendary 1963 anthology “</strong><i><strong>I Tre Volti della Paura”</strong></i> (\"<i>Black Sabbath\"</i>) to the silver screen. A cornerstone of Italian horror, this gothic triptych features Boris Karloff in one of his most memorable roles, weaving together three chilling tales: a supernatural stalker haunting a lonely woman, a vampiric family curse, and a nail-biting story of a phone call from a stranger.&nbsp;</p><p>Stylish, suspenseful, and macabre, it’s a cult classic that inspired generations of filmmakers. <strong><u>The film will be screened in English language.</u></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To heighten the atmosphere, the film will be paired with <strong>immersive Burlesque and Drag performances</strong>. Expect glam ghouls, spooky acts, and campy homages to Bava’s surreal imagery. Each act will be tailored to echo the film’s haunting themes, turning the interval into a living, breathing extension of Bava’s eerie universe.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Come dressed for the occasion, settle into Love Affair Basement's moody setting, and get ready for a Halloween celebration like no other…if you dare 🦇 🥀 🕯 🪦 🩸</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/loveaffairbasement>Love Affair Basement </a><a href=/hashtag/halloween>Halloween </a><a href=/hashtag/burlesque>Burlesque </a><a href=/hashtag/cinema>Cinema </a><a href=/hashtag/drag>Drag </a><a href=/hashtag/cabaret>Cabaret </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">The Lineup\r\n            <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n            </svg>\r\n            </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"lineup\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Luna Lussuria</strong> &nbsp;<i>(@luna_lussuria) &nbsp;</i>- &nbsp;<i>Witchy, mischievous, dark Burlesque</i></p><p><strong>Co Kendrah</strong> &nbsp;<i>(@cokendrah) &nbsp;</i>- &nbsp;<i>Vampiric, blasphemous, shape-shifting Drag&nbsp;</i></p><p><strong>Pamela Von Horn </strong><i>(@pamela_von_horn) &nbsp;</i><strong>- &nbsp;</strong><i>Sapphic, witty Neo-Burlesque with a spooky twist&nbsp;</i></p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">Our Vibe\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n        <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.1737