            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 259083,
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\t6:30 PM –  MARGINAL FILM SESSION IV  – RESISTANCE Tickets | 31 Oct @ Pelican House, London | Pay What You Can to £11 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/48b1003e3f996725d29958c6407c7628d895b6c59423ce86809d490268602a4108a2f455d42039841e6a37763c49dbae39bb99ea85f2d7ab12be682be45831a8/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2025-10-27\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\" &#128467; Friday 31st October, 7pm start (doors 6.30pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)  &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 35 minutesTo be followed with a Q&amp;amp;A session with Uilton Oliveira, the Festival Curator from Brazil All films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles. / Sinopse em portugu&#234;s abaixo. 1. Baba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra - Free Babassu.  By Law or by ForceDocumentary, 30′ min, All ages, 2025. Directors: &#201;lida Maria Brito &amp;amp; Ricardo Augusto Pereira. The film portrays the struggle of women to protect the “mother palm” - the babassu tree. For years, they were accused of stealing babassu nuts left to rot on large estates — nuts they gathered, cracked, and turned into oil and cooking fat to sustain their families. To change this reality, the babassu nut breakers organised and fought for laws to preserve the palm and guarantee free access to lands with babassu trees. 2 – Mansos  - MeekFiction, 20′ min, 14+, 2024. Director: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Benedita is a young woman marked by a past tragedy: the murder of her mother, Tereza. Now a community leader, she is determined to uphold her mother’s struggle in an endless pursuit of vengeance. 3 – Resist&#234;ncia - ResistanceDocumentary, 09′min, All ages, 2023. Director: Juraci J&#250;nior.Known as the “Devil’s Railroad”, the Madeira-Mamor&#233; Railway began to be built in the Amazon at the end of the 19th century. To this day, it leaves scars across the land it once traversed. 4 – A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)- The Ship That Never Lands Documentary Science Fiction, 15′ min, 10+, 2025. Director: Ellen Morais.The Ship That Never Lands hovers above a quilombola community in the hinterlands of Para&#237;ba. Local residents must face the consequences of this pehomenon. A blend of science fiction and documentary set in the lands of Aruanda. 5 – A Chuva do Caju -  The Cashew RainDocumentary, 21′min, 10+, 2023. Director: Alan Schvarsberg.In the heart of a hidden valley deep in central Brazil, Seu Alvino and Dona Neusa plant and harvest what the land gives - like the cerrado cashew and the baru nut. After more than two centuries, time continues to move slowly in the quilombo of V&#227;o de Almas, despite the increasingly severe drought. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sBaba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra (PI)Document&#225;rio, 30′, Livre, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: &#201;lida Maria Brito e Ricardo Augusto Pereira.Legenda Descritiva.O filme mostra a luta das mulheres para defender a m&#227;e palmeira, a &#225;rvore do baba&#231;u. Por muitos anos, foram acusadas de roubar o coco que se estragava nas fazendas, coletado para quebrar e produzir &#243;leo e azeite, vendidos para garantia da subsist&#234;ncia dessas mulheres e de suas fam&#237;lias. Para mudar esse quadro, as quebradeiras de coco aprovaram leis de preserva&#231;&#227;o da palmeira e de livre acesso &#224;s terras com baba&#231;u.Mansos (MT)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 20′, 14 anos, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Legenda Descritiva.Benedita &#233; uma jovem que cresceu com uma marca em seu passado: o assassinato de sua m&#227;e, Tereza. Benedita, agora lideran&#231;a, far&#225; valer a luta de sua m&#227;e em uma busca incessante por vingan&#231;a.Resist&#234;ncia (RO)Document&#225;rio, 09′, Livre, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juraci J&#250;nior.Conhecida como “Ferrovia do Diabo”, a Estrada de Ferro Madeira-Mamor&#233; come&#231;ou a ser constru&#237;da na Amaz&#244;nia, no final do s&#233;culo XIX, e at&#233; hoje exp&#245;e cicatrizes por onde passou.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)Fic&#231;&#227;o Cient&#237;fica Documental, 15′, 10 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Ellen Morais.Libras.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa paira sobre uma comunidade quilombola no sert&#227;o da Para&#237;ba. Os moradores locais precisam lidar com as consequ&#234;ncias desse acontecimento. Uma fic&#231;&#227;o cient&#237;fica documental nas terras de Aruanda.A Chuva do Caju (GO e DF)Document&#225;rio, 21′, 10 anos, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Alan Schvarsberg.Legenda Descritiva.No cora&#231;&#227;o de um vale escondido nas profundezas do Brasil central, Seu Alvino e Dona Neusa plantam e colhem o que a terra d&#225;, como o cajuzinho do cerrado e o baru. Ap&#243;s mais de dois s&#233;culos, o tempo continua passando lento no quilombo V&#227;o de Almas, apesar da seca cada vez mais severa.\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"6:30 PM –  MARGINAL FILM SESSION IV  – RESISTANCE Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d19fb19a-467a-4bb6-a3f0-3da5a2e8a368.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"6:30 PM –  MARGINAL FILM SESSION IV  – RESISTANCE Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d19fb19a-467a-4bb6-a3f0-3da5a2e8a368.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\" &#128467; Friday 31st October, 7pm start (doors 6.30pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)  &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 35 minutesTo be followed with a Q&amp;amp;A session with Uilton Oliveira, the Festival Curator from Brazil All films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles. / Sinopse em portugu&#234;s abaixo. 1. Baba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra - Free Babassu.  By Law or by ForceDocumentary, 30′ min, All ages, 2025. Directors: &#201;lida Maria Brito &amp;amp; Ricardo Augusto Pereira. The film portrays the struggle of women to protect the “mother palm” - the babassu tree. For years, they were accused of stealing babassu nuts left to rot on large estates — nuts they gathered, cracked, and turned into oil and cooking fat to sustain their families. To change this reality, the babassu nut breakers organised and fought for laws to preserve the palm and guarantee free access to lands with babassu trees. 2 – Mansos  - MeekFiction, 20′ min, 14+, 2024. Director: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Benedita is a young woman marked by a past tragedy: the murder of her mother, Tereza. Now a community leader, she is determined to uphold her mother’s struggle in an endless pursuit of vengeance. 3 – Resist&#234;ncia - ResistanceDocumentary, 09′min, All ages, 2023. Director: Juraci J&#250;nior.Known as the “Devil’s Railroad”, the Madeira-Mamor&#233; Railway began to be built in the Amazon at the end of the 19th century. To this day, it leaves scars across the land it once traversed. 4 – A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)- The Ship That Never Lands Documentary Science Fiction, 15′ min, 10+, 2025. Director: Ellen Morais.The Ship That Never Lands hovers above a quilombola community in the hinterlands of Para&#237;ba. Local residents must face the consequences of this pehomenon. A blend of science fiction and documentary set in the lands of Aruanda. 5 – A Chuva do Caju -  The Cashew RainDocumentary, 21′min, 10+, 2023. Director: Alan Schvarsberg.In the heart of a hidden valley deep in central Brazil, Seu Alvino and Dona Neusa plant and harvest what the land gives - like the cerrado cashew and the baru nut. After more than two centuries, time continues to move slowly in the quilombo of V&#227;o de Almas, despite the increasingly severe drought. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sBaba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra (PI)Document&#225;rio, 30′, Livre, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: &#201;lida Maria Brito e Ricardo Augusto Pereira.Legenda Descritiva.O filme mostra a luta das mulheres para defender a m&#227;e palmeira, a &#225;rvore do baba&#231;u. Por muitos anos, foram acusadas de roubar o coco que se estragava nas fazendas, coletado para quebrar e produzir &#243;leo e azeite, vendidos para garantia da subsist&#234;ncia dessas mulheres e de suas fam&#237;lias. Para mudar esse quadro, as quebradeiras de coco aprovaram leis de preserva&#231;&#227;o da palmeira e de livre acesso &#224;s terras com baba&#231;u.Mansos (MT)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 20′, 14 anos, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Legenda Descritiva.Benedita &#233; uma jovem que cresceu com uma marca em seu passado: o assassinato de sua m&#227;e, Tereza. Benedita, agora lideran&#231;a, far&#225; valer a luta de sua m&#227;e em uma busca incessante por vingan&#231;a.Resist&#234;ncia (RO)Document&#225;rio, 09′, Livre, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juraci J&#250;nior.Conhecida como “Ferrovia do Diabo”, a Estrada de Ferro Madeira-Mamor&#233; come&#231;ou a ser constru&#237;da na Amaz&#244;nia, no final do s&#233;culo XIX, e at&#233; hoje exp&#245;e cicatrizes por onde passou.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)Fic&#231;&#227;o Cient&#237;fica Documental, 15′, 10 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Ellen Morais.Libras.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa paira sobre uma comunidade quilombola no sert&#227;o da Para&#237;ba. Os moradores locais precisam lidar com as consequ&#234;ncias desse acontecimento. Uma fic&#231;&#227;o cient&#237;fica documental nas terras de Aruanda.A Chuva do Caju (GO e DF)Document&#225;rio, 21′, 10 anos, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Alan Schvarsberg.Legenda Descritiva.No cora&#231;&#227;o de um vale escondido nas profundezas do Brasil central, Seu Alvino e Dona Neusa plantam e colhem o que a terra d&#225;, como o cajuzinho do cerrado e o baru. Ap&#243;s mais de dois s&#233;culos, o tempo continua passando lento no quilombo V&#227;o de Almas, apesar da seca cada vez mais severa.\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | 6:30 PM –  MARGINAL FILM SESSION IV  – RESISTANCE | Friday 31st October 2025 @ Pelican House | Pay What You Can to £11 | Find event and ticket information for The Marginal Film Festival\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present