">\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-bg-holder entry__bg-img-holder\">\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"feature-price\">£11 to £16</div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <img class=\"lazy\" src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/bannerimage/3da4ddef-7ff3-4948-b6b7-02092648c8d7.jpg\" alt=\"Queer House Party does Brighton\" />\r\n                                <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Queer House Party does Brighton\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Concorde 2 - Saturday 15th November 2025</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"Festival\",\"name\": \"6:30 PM –  MARGINAL FILM SESSION IV  – RESISTANCE\",\"startDate\": \"2025-10-31T18:30:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2025-10-31T21:45:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d19fb19a-467a-4bb6-a3f0-3da5a2e8a368.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \" &#128467; Friday 31st October, 7pm start (doors 6.30pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)  &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 35 minutesTo be followed with a Q&amp;amp;A session with Uilton Oliveira, the Festival Curator from Brazil All films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles. / Sinopse em portugu&#234;s abaixo. 1. Baba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra - Free Babassu.  By Law or by ForceDocumentary, 30′ min, All ages, 2025. Directors: &#201;lida Maria Brito &amp;amp; Ricardo Augusto Pereira. The film portrays the struggle of women to protect the “mother palm” - the babassu tree. For years, they were accused of stealing babassu nuts left to rot on large estates — nuts they gathered, cracked, and turned into oil and cooking fat to sustain their families. To change this reality, the babassu nut breakers organised and fought for laws to preserve the palm and guarantee free access to lands with babassu trees. 2 – Mansos  - MeekFiction, 20′ min, 14+, 2024. Director: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Benedita is a young woman marked by a past tragedy: the murder of her mother, Tereza. Now a community leader, she is determined to uphold her mother’s struggle in an endless pursuit of vengeance. 3 – Resist&#234;ncia - ResistanceDocumentary, 09′min, All ages, 2023. Director: Juraci J&#250;nior.Known as the “Devil’s Railroad”, the Madeira-Mamor&#233; Railway began to be built in the Amazon at the end of the 19th century. To this day, it leaves scars across the land it once traversed. 4 – A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)- The Ship That Never Lands Documentary Science Fiction, 15′ min, 10+, 2025. Director: Ellen Morais.The Ship That Never Lands hovers above a quilombola community in the hinterlands of Para&#237;ba. Local residents must face the consequences of this pehomenon. A blend of science fiction and documentary set in the lands of Aruanda. 5 – A Chuva do Caju -  The Cashew RainDocumentary, 21′min, 10+, 2023. Director: Alan Schvarsberg.In the heart of a hidden valley deep in central Brazil, Seu Alvino and Dona Neusa plant and harvest what the land gives - like the cerrado cashew and the baru nut. After more than two centuries, time continues to move slowly in the quilombo of V&#227;o de Almas, despite the increasingly severe drought. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sBaba&#231;u Livre.  Na lei ou na Marra (PI)Document&#225;rio, 30′, Livre, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: &#201;lida Maria Brito e Ricardo Augusto Pereira.Legenda Descritiva.O filme mostra a luta das mulheres para defender a m&#227;e palmeira, a &#225;rvore do baba&#231;u. Por muitos anos, foram acusadas de roubar o coco que se estragava nas fazendas, coletado para quebrar e produzir &#243;leo e azeite, vendidos para garantia da subsist&#234;ncia dessas mulheres e de suas fam&#237;lias. Para mudar esse quadro, as quebradeiras de coco aprovaram leis de preserva&#231;&#227;o da palmeira e de livre acesso &#224;s terras com baba&#231;u.Mansos (MT)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 20′, 14 anos, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juliana Seg&#243;via.Legenda Descritiva.Benedita &#233; uma jovem que cresceu com uma marca em seu passado: o assassinato de sua m&#227;e, Tereza. Benedita, agora lideran&#231;a, far&#225; valer a luta de sua m&#227;e em uma busca incessante por vingan&#231;a.Resist&#234;ncia (RO)Document&#225;rio, 09′, Livre, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Juraci J&#250;nior.Conhecida como “Ferrovia do Diabo”, a Estrada de Ferro Madeira-Mamor&#233; come&#231;ou a ser constru&#237;da na Amaz&#244;nia, no final do s&#233;culo XIX, e at&#233; hoje exp&#245;e cicatrizes por onde passou.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa (PB)Fic&#231;&#227;o Cient&#237;fica Documental, 15′, 10 anos, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Ellen Morais.Libras.A Nave Que Nunca Pousa paira sobre uma comunidade quilombola no sert&#227;o da Para&#237;ba. Os moradores locais precisam lidar com as consequ&#234;ncias desse acontecimento. Uma fic&#231;&#227;o cient&#237;fica documental nas terras de Aruanda.A Chuva do Caju (GO e DF)Document&#225;rio, 21′, 10 anos, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Alan Schvarsberg.Legenda Descritiva.No cora&#231;&#227;o de um vale escondido nas profundezas do Brasil central, Seu Alvino e Dona Neusa plantam e colhem o que a terra d&#225;, como o cajuzinho do cerrado e o baru. Ap&#243;s mais de dois s&#233;culos, o tempo continua passando lento no quilombo V&#227;o de Almas, apesar da seca cada vez mais severa.\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Pelican House\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Pelican House, 144 Cambridge Heath Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E1 5QJ\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.52415\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0547129\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-31T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\",\"lowPrice\":11,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-31T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Solidarity Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\",\"price\":11,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-31T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Contribute what you can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-05T02:53:45:45+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-05T02:53:45:45+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-10-31T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T02:48:46:46+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/the-marginal-film-festival\", \"description\" : \"&#127916; The Marginal Film Festival - London EditionFor the first time, Brazil’s Mostra do Filme Marginal (@mostradofilmemarginal) lands in London.  Follow our London instagram here for more details.&#128197; 26 Oct - 1 Nov 2025&#128205; Evening screenings across East, Central &amp;amp; West London Each day’s event is listed below - check details &amp;amp; confirm your spot. Mostra do Filme Marginal is an initiative that aims to value and promote independent film productions. It is not competitive; it aims at integration.Our strategy is to use the project as an instrument of diffusion, reflection, encouragement, and collective organisation of the public towards a popular, authorial, and critical cinema. In this way, we open space for works that bring to the screen characters and themes marginalised by the current sociopolitical system, offering a critical gaze beyond commercial circuits.This 5th edition, Cinema of Struggle: Art of Liberation, brings this cinema of resistance into focus — and now, to London. &#127903;️ Screenings are free, with Pay What You Can and Solidarity Tickets available.Your support directly helps cover travel costs for our curator from Brazil and makes this festival possible.\", \"name\" : \"The Marginal Film Festival\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/30788/630-pm-marginal-film-session-iv-resistance';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            // Send the like to the service\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n  