v>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">4.30 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING - DAY SESSION</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>&nbsp;🗓 Saturday 1st November, 5pm start (doors 4.30pm)</strong><br><strong>📍&nbsp; Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>🔎 Room: Common Room&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Rating: Suitable for all ages +&nbsp;<br>Duration: 59 minutes<br>💬 Includes a Q&amp;A session with the Festival Curator from Brazil</p><p><i>All films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Join us for an afternoon of Brazilian short films celebrating art, resilience, and social inclusion. These stories highlight musicians, athletes, and families who transform barriers into bridges through creativity, community, and care.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1 - O Som da Pele</strong><i> &nbsp;<strong>(</strong></i><strong>A Touch of Sound)</strong><br><i>Documentary, 22′ min, All ages, 2024. Director: Marcos Santos.</i></p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:33.56%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:515/290;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/ba166514-b161-4548-b459-a035a4c5268a.png  \" width=\"515\" height=\"290\"></figure><p>This documentary follows the journey of Irton Mário, known as Mestre Batman - a musician and educator who founded the group Os Batuqueiros do Silêncio (“The Drummers of Silence”). Formed by people with partial or total hearing loss, the group uses art as a means of integration and social inclusion.</p><p><br><strong>2- O Som das Redes &nbsp;(T</strong><i><strong>he Sound of Nets)</strong></i><br><i>Documentary, 18′ min, All ages, 2024. Director: Assaggi Piá.</i></p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:25.45%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:700/624;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/0cb685b1-6cdd-4072-8315-92f6f0df5d35.png  \" width=\"700\" height=\"624\"></figure><p>The film revisits the story of Selmi Nascimento, a blind football player who became seven-time Brazilian champion and three-time world champion with the Instituto de Cegos da Bahia (ICB). He also won the Copa América representing the Brazilian National Team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3- Família Nascimento </strong><i><strong>- (Nascimento Family)</strong></i><br><i>Fiction, 19′ min, All ages, 2025. Directors: Ingrid Nascimento &amp; Victor Nascimento.</i></p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:27.14%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:463/273;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/6c5c3d25-209d-4f3e-9f0d-a158c0f3fc6e.png  \" width=\"463\" height=\"273\"></figure><p>Through personal archives, this film reveals memories of a family that confronted the challenges of cerebral palsy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🎶 &nbsp;Stay With us after the screenings for the festival’s closing session — ending with music, conversation, and a small celebration to wrap up the festival (closing session details <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\">here</a>)</h2><hr><h2><strong>Sinopse em português</strong></h2><p><strong>O Som da Pele (PE)</strong><br>Documentário, 22′, Livre, 2024. Direção: Marcos Santos.<br>Audiodescrição.</p><p>O Som da Pele é um documentário que acompanha a trajetória de Irton Mário, conhecido como Mestre Batman, músico e educador responsável por fundar o grupo “Os Batuqueiros do Silêncio”. Formado por pessoas com surdez total ou parcial, o grupo utiliza a arte como meio de integração e inclusão social.</p><p><strong>O Som das Redes (BA)</strong><br>Documentário, 18′, Livre, 2024. Direção: Assaggi Piá.<br>Libras.</p><p>O documentário revisita a trajetória de Selmi Nascimento, jogador de futebol de cegos, que conquistou o heptacampeonato brasileiro e o tricampeonato mundial pelo Instituto de Cegos da Bahia – ICB, além de ter sido campeão da Copa América, defendendo a Seleção Brasileira.</p><p><strong>Família Nascimento (SP)</strong><br>Ficção, 19′, Livre, 2025. Direção: Ingrid Nascimento e Victor Nascimento.<br>Legenda Descritiva.</p><p>A partir de arquivos pessoais, o vídeo revela memórias de uma família que lutou contra a paralisia cerebral.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>🎶 Fique com a gente após as exibições para a sessão de encerramento do festival — com mais filme, música e muita conversa!&nbsp;</p><p>(detalhes da sessão de encerramento <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\">aqui</a>).</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/pelicanhouse>Pelican House </a><a href=/hashtag/festival>Festival </a><a href=/hashtag/community>Community </a><a href=/hashtag/screening>Screening </a><a href=/hashtag/documentary>Documentary </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"organiser\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">Organised By\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                        </h4>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"organiserblock\">\r\n                        <div class=\"organiser-center\">\r\n\r\n                            \r\n                            <div class=\"left-half\">\r\n                                <img class=\"organiser-logo\" height=\"142\" width=\"200\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/logo/19905af4-3908-4495-bc86-a1b2566f653d.png\" alt=\"The Marginal Film Festival\" />\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"right-half\">\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"organiser-name\">\r\n                                    The Marginal Film Festival\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <p class=\"organiser-event\">Organiser of 4.30 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING - DAY SESSION</p>\r\n\r\n          