vg>\r\n                                <p>Newham</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </label>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <div class=\"nav-menu-link\">\r\n                            <a href=\"/accountlogin\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"heading-4\">Login\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-menu-link\">\r\n                            <a href=\"/register\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"heading-4\">Register\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n<div class=\"nav-advert\">\r\n    <div id=\"eventscontent\" class=\"module-box row\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"newspanel\" id=\"tab-all\" style=\"display: block;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row row-16\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\r\n                    <a href=\"/event/29613/queer-house-party-does-brighton\" aria-label=\"Queer House Party - Brighton w/ Dykes on Decks & Crushed\">\r\n                        <article class=\"entry\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-bg-holder entry__bg-img-holder\">\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"feature-price\">£11 to £16</div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <img class=\"lazy\" src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/bannerimage/3da4ddef-7ff3-4948-b6b7-02092648c8d7.jpg\" alt=\"Queer House Party does Brighton\" />\r\n                                <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Queer House Party does Brighton\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Concorde 2 - Saturday 15th November 2025</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"Festival\",\"name\": \"4.30 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING - DAY SESSION\",\"startDate\": \"2025-11-01T15:00:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2025-11-01T17:45:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/7759a177-e2bc-4f7c-9b12-20a62d379b13.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \" &#128467; Saturday 1st November, 5pm start (doors 4.30pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)  &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for all ages + Duration: 59 minutes&#128172; Includes a Q&amp;amp;A session with the Festival Curator from BrazilAll films are in Brazilian Portuguese with English subtitles. Join us for an afternoon of Brazilian short films celebrating art, resilience, and social inclusion. These stories highlight musicians, athletes, and families who transform barriers into bridges through creativity, community, and care. 1 - O Som da Pele  (A Touch of Sound)Documentary, 22′ min, All ages, 2024. Director: Marcos Santos.This documentary follows the journey of Irton M&#225;rio, known as Mestre Batman - a musician and educator who founded the group Os Batuqueiros do Sil&#234;ncio (“The Drummers of Silence”). Formed by people with partial or total hearing loss, the group uses art as a means of integration and social inclusion.2- O Som das Redes  (The Sound of Nets)Documentary, 18′ min, All ages, 2024. Director: Assaggi Pi&#225;.The film revisits the story of Selmi Nascimento, a blind football player who became seven-time Brazilian champion and three-time world champion with the Instituto de Cegos da Bahia (ICB). He also won the Copa Am&#233;rica representing the Brazilian National Team. 3- Fam&#237;lia Nascimento - (Nascimento Family)Fiction, 19′ min, All ages, 2025. Directors: Ingrid Nascimento &amp;amp; Victor Nascimento.Through personal archives, this film reveals memories of a family that confronted the challenges of cerebral palsy.  &#127926;  Stay With us after the screenings for the festival’s closing session — ending with music, conversation, and a small celebration to wrap up the festival (closing session details here)Sinopse em portugu&#234;sO Som da Pele (PE)Document&#225;rio, 22′, Livre, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Marcos Santos.Audiodescri&#231;&#227;o.O Som da Pele &#233; um document&#225;rio que acompanha a trajet&#243;ria de Irton M&#225;rio, conhecido como Mestre Batman, m&#250;sico e educador respons&#225;vel por fundar o grupo “Os Batuqueiros do Sil&#234;ncio”. Formado por pessoas com surdez total ou parcial, o grupo utiliza a arte como meio de integra&#231;&#227;o e inclus&#227;o social.O Som das Redes (BA)Document&#225;rio, 18′, Livre, 2024. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Assaggi Pi&#225;.Libras.O document&#225;rio revisita a trajet&#243;ria de Selmi Nascimento, jogador de futebol de cegos, que conquistou o heptacampeonato brasileiro e o tricampeonato mundial pelo Instituto de Cegos da Bahia – ICB, al&#233;m de ter sido campe&#227;o da Copa Am&#233;rica, defendendo a Sele&#231;&#227;o Brasileira.Fam&#237;lia Nascimento (SP)Fic&#231;&#227;o, 19′, Livre, 2025. Dire&#231;&#227;o: Ingrid Nascimento e Victor Nascimento.Legenda Descritiva.A partir de arquivos pessoais, o v&#237;deo revela mem&#243;rias de uma fam&#237;lia que lutou contra a paralisia cerebral. &#127926; Fique com a gente ap&#243;s as exibi&#231;&#245;es para a sess&#227;o de encerramento do festival — com mais filme, m&#250;sica e muita conversa.  (detalhes da sess&#227;o de encerramento aqui).\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Pelican House\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Pelican House, 144 Cambridge Heath Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E1 5QJ\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.52415\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0547129\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T14:00:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session\",\"lowPrice\":11,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T03:13:14:14+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T03:13:14:14+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T14:00:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Solidarity Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session\",\"price\":11,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T03:13:14:14+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T03:13:14:14+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T14:00:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Pay what you can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-05T02:56:39:39+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-05T02:56:39:39+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T14:00:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T03:15:49:49+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T03:15:49:49+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/the-marginal-film-festival\", \"description\" : \"&#127916; The Marginal Film Festival - London EditionFor the first time, Brazil’s Mostra do Filme Marginal (@mostradofilmemarginal) lands in London.  Follow our London instagram here for more details.&#128197; 26 Oct - 1 Nov 2025&#128205; Evening screenings across East, Central &amp;amp; West London Each day’s event is listed below - check details &amp;amp; confirm your spot. Mostra do Filme Marginal is an initiative that aims to value and promote independent film productions. It is not competitive; it aims at integration.Our strategy is to use the project as an instrument of diffusion, reflection, encouragement, and collective organisation of the public towards a popular, authorial, and critical cinema. In this way, we open space for works that bring to the screen characters and themes marginalised by the current sociopolitical system, offering a critical gaze beyond commercial circuits.This 5th edition, Cinema of Struggle: Art of Liberation, brings this cinema of resistance into focus — and now, to London. &#127903;️ Screenings are free, with Pay What You Can and Solidarity Tickets available.Your support directly helps cover travel costs for our curator from Brazil and makes this festival possible.\", \"name\" : \"The Marginal Film Festival\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/30849/430-pm-festival-closing-day-session';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            // Send the like to the service\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' 