            "size": 248740,
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\t6:45 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING  – EVENING SESSION  Tickets | 01 Nov @ Pelican House, London | Pay What You Can to £11 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/48b1003e3f996725d29958c6407c7628d895b6c59423ce86809d490268602a4108a2f455d42039841e6a37763c49dbae39bb99ea85f2d7ab12be682be45831a8/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2025-10-24\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\" &#128467; Saturday 1st November, 7pm start (doors 6.45pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)   &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 15 minutes&#128172; Includes a Q&amp;amp;A session with the Festival Curator from Brazil InDUBt&#225;vel 2 – A Reggae Document (Brazil/SP, UK, France &amp;amp; Spain) Documentary, 17′, 2023. Director: William Sernagiotto.English subtitles.The independent documentary about Reggae and Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, which already has a “demo” version (containing records from 2003 to 2009), now receives its official version, reinforcing the fact that it is one of the first films made in the country about this musical genre.For 75 minutes, the film discusses the relevance of the ABC and Greater SP region in the context of Reggae music and the current Sound System. Spoken in 4 languages, it contains images of presentations, festivals and testimonials captured in Brazil, France, Spain and England between 2016 and 2019. The cast includes more than 40 characters from the national and international scene. &#127926;  The evening flows into a closing gathering - an open space for music, sharing, and conversation. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sInDUBt&#225;vel 2 – Reggae Documento (Brasil/SP, Reino Unido, Fran&#231;a e Espanha)Document&#225;rio, 17′, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: William Sernagiotto.Legenda em Portugu&#234;s.O document&#225;rio independente sobre Reggae e Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, que j&#225; possui uma vers&#227;o “demo” (contendo registros de 2003 &#224; 2009), agora recebe a sua vers&#227;o oficial, refor&#231;ando o fato de ser um dos primeiros filmes realizados no pa&#237;s sobre esse g&#234;nero musical. Durante 75 minutos, o longa aborda a relev&#226;ncia da regi&#227;o do ABC e grande SP perante o cen&#225;rio da m&#250;sica Reggae e Sound System atual. Falado em 4 idiomas (legendado em portugu&#234;s e ingl&#234;s).\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"6:45 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING  – EVENING SESSION  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/58c7f934-fc3d-4967-84c6-0d9af0f24661.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"6:45 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING  – EVENING SESSION  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/58c7f934-fc3d-4967-84c6-0d9af0f24661.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\" &#128467; Saturday 1st November, 7pm start (doors 6.45pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)   &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 15 minutes&#128172; Includes a Q&amp;amp;A session with the Festival Curator from Brazil InDUBt&#225;vel 2 – A Reggae Document (Brazil/SP, UK, France &amp;amp; Spain) Documentary, 17′, 2023. Director: William Sernagiotto.English subtitles.The independent documentary about Reggae and Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, which already has a “demo” version (containing records from 2003 to 2009), now receives its official version, reinforcing the fact that it is one of the first films made in the country about this musical genre.For 75 minutes, the film discusses the relevance of the ABC and Greater SP region in the context of Reggae music and the current Sound System. Spoken in 4 languages, it contains images of presentations, festivals and testimonials captured in Brazil, France, Spain and England between 2016 and 2019. The cast includes more than 40 characters from the national and international scene. &#127926;  The evening flows into a closing gathering - an open space for music, sharing, and conversation. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sInDUBt&#225;vel 2 – Reggae Documento (Brasil/SP, Reino Unido, Fran&#231;a e Espanha)Document&#225;rio, 17′, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: William Sernagiotto.Legenda em Portugu&#234;s.O document&#225;rio independente sobre Reggae e Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, que j&#225; possui uma vers&#227;o “demo” (contendo registros de 2003 &#224; 2009), agora recebe a sua vers&#227;o oficial, refor&#231;ando o fato de ser um dos primeiros filmes realizados no pa&#237;s sobre esse g&#234;nero musical. Durante 75 minutos, o longa aborda a relev&#226;ncia da regi&#227;o do ABC e grande SP perante o cen&#225;rio da m&#250;sica Reggae e Sound System atual. Falado em 4 idiomas (legendado em portugu&#234;s e ingl&#234;s).\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | 6:45 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING  – EVENING SESSION  | Saturday 1st November 2025 @ Pelican House | Pay What You Can to £11 | Find event and ticket information for The Marginal Film Festival\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n   