  <div class=\"row row-16\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\r\n                    <a href=\"/event/29613/queer-house-party-does-brighton\" aria-label=\"Queer House Party - Brighton w/ Dykes on Decks & Crushed\">\r\n                        <article class=\"entry\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-bg-holder entry__bg-img-holder\">\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"feature-price\">£11 to £16</div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <img class=\"lazy\" src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/bannerimage/3da4ddef-7ff3-4948-b6b7-02092648c8d7.jpg\" alt=\"Queer House Party does Brighton\" />\r\n                                <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Queer House Party does Brighton\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Concorde 2 - Saturday 15th November 2025</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"Festival\",\"name\": \"6:45 PM – FESTIVAL CLOSING  – EVENING SESSION \",\"startDate\": \"2025-11-01T18:30:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2025-11-01T23:30:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/58c7f934-fc3d-4967-84c6-0d9af0f24661.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \" &#128467; Saturday 1st November, 7pm start (doors 6.45pm)&#128205;  Pelican House (144 Cambridge Heath Rd, Bethnal Green, London E1 5QJ)   &#128270; Room: Common Room Rating: Suitable for ages 16+ Duration: 1 hour 15 minutes&#128172; Includes a Q&amp;amp;A session with the Festival Curator from Brazil InDUBt&#225;vel 2 – A Reggae Document (Brazil/SP, UK, France &amp;amp; Spain) Documentary, 17′, 2023. Director: William Sernagiotto.English subtitles.The independent documentary about Reggae and Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, which already has a “demo” version (containing records from 2003 to 2009), now receives its official version, reinforcing the fact that it is one of the first films made in the country about this musical genre.For 75 minutes, the film discusses the relevance of the ABC and Greater SP region in the context of Reggae music and the current Sound System. Spoken in 4 languages, it contains images of presentations, festivals and testimonials captured in Brazil, France, Spain and England between 2016 and 2019. The cast includes more than 40 characters from the national and international scene. &#127926;  The evening flows into a closing gathering - an open space for music, sharing, and conversation. Sinopse em portugu&#234;sInDUBt&#225;vel 2 – Reggae Documento (Brasil/SP, Reino Unido, Fran&#231;a e Espanha)Document&#225;rio, 17′, 2023. Dire&#231;&#227;o: William Sernagiotto.Legenda em Portugu&#234;s.O document&#225;rio independente sobre Reggae e Sound System “InDUBt&#225;vel”, que j&#225; possui uma vers&#227;o “demo” (contendo registros de 2003 &#224; 2009), agora recebe a sua vers&#227;o oficial, refor&#231;ando o fato de ser um dos primeiros filmes realizados no pa&#237;s sobre esse g&#234;nero musical. Durante 75 minutos, o longa aborda a relev&#226;ncia da regi&#227;o do ABC e grande SP perante o cen&#225;rio da m&#250;sica Reggae e Sound System atual. Falado em 4 idiomas (legendado em portugu&#234;s e ingl&#234;s).\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Pelican House\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Pelican House, 144 Cambridge Heath Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E1 5QJ\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.52415\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0547129\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\",\"lowPrice\":11,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Solidarity Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\",\"price\":11,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Pay what you can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-05T03:04:12:12+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-05T03:04:12:12+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2025-11-01T17:30:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-10-02T21:52:28:28+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/the-marginal-film-festival\", \"description\" : \"&#127916; The Marginal Film Festival - London EditionFor the first time, Brazil’s Mostra do Filme Marginal (@mostradofilmemarginal) lands in London.  Follow our London instagram here for more details.&#128197; 26 Oct - 1 Nov 2025&#128205; Evening screenings across East, Central &amp;amp; West London Each day’s event is listed below - check details &amp;amp; confirm your spot. Mostra do Filme Marginal is an initiative that aims to value and promote independent film productions. It is not competitive; it aims at integration.Our strategy is to use the project as an instrument of diffusion, reflection, encouragement, and collective organisation of the public towards a popular, authorial, and critical cinema. In this way, we open space for works that bring to the screen characters and themes marginalised by the current sociopolitical system, offering a critical gaze beyond commercial circuits.This 5th edition, Cinema of Struggle: Art of Liberation, brings this cinema of resistance into focus — and now, to London. &#127903;️ Screenings are free, with Pay What You Can and Solidarity Tickets available.Your support directly helps cover travel costs for our curator from Brazil and makes this festival possible.\", \"name\" : \"The Marginal Film Festival\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/30850/645-pm-festival-closing-evening-session';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            // Send the like to the service\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                dataType: \"json\",\r\n                success: function (r) {\r\n                    if (r.d !