ailable on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Saving Face screening & social (18+)</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p>Hey gays! On November 6th we are screening <strong>Saving Face</strong>, the iconic queer romcom. After the screening, we will be heading across the road for a social so we can yap about the movie and make some friends :) This event is for Queer POC women, non-binary and trans folk.</p><p><br><strong>Key details</strong>:</p><ul><li>Thursday November 6th, 6pm</li><li>Hackney Picturehouse</li><li>Social after at the Old Ship (1 min walk from the cinema)</li></ul><p><br><strong>Accessibility:</strong></p><ul><li>The screen will be on the ground floor and has step-free access</li><li>There is a wheelchair space in the screen - please contact us beforehand if you require this</li></ul></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/hackneypicturehouse>Hackney Picturehouse </a><a href=/hashtag/social>Social </a><a href=/hashtag/screening>Screening </a><a href=/hashtag/poc>POC </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"need-to-know\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">What You Need To Know\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                        </h4>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Age restriction: 18+\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 44px; margin-bottom: 44px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                <div id=\"terms\">\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                        <section>\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Terms & Conditions\r\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n        <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n    </svg>\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <ul class=\"event-points\">\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    You must be 18+</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Cisgender men will not gain entry</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    This event is for Queer POC women, non-binary and trans folk</li>\r\n            \r\n                </ul>\r\n                            <div style=\"margin-top: 44px; margin-bottom: 44px\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n            \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"organiser\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\"