            "size": 205909,
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tQueerkamp by Chris Westendorp & Lucas van der Rhee  Tickets | 12 Nov @ UCL East - One Pool Street, London | FREE | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/48b1003e3f996725d29958c6407c7628d895b6c59423ce86809d490268602a4108a2f455d42039841e6a37763c49dbae39bb99ea85f2d7ab12be682be45831a8/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2025-10-28\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Spectra Presents: Queerkamp, a film by Chris Westendorp and Lucas van der Rhee&#128197; Wednesday 12 November&#128342; 7.00pm&#128205; UCL East Community Cinema – One Pool StreetSensitive and deeply observational, Queerkamp offers an intimate glimpse into the world of a queer youth summer camp, where young people spend a week among peers who share similar experiences and questions of identity. With tenderness and courage, the film captures moments of vulnerability, joy and self-discovery as the participants begin to embrace who they are, often for the first time.Through its gentle, empathetic lens, Queerkamp reveals the quiet strength and resilience that emerge in this safe space, celebrating the transformative power of queer community.Queerkamp dir. Chris Westendorp &amp;amp; Lucas van der Rhee | 60 min | 2024Queerkamp will be preceded by the short film A film, My Body by one of our recent UCL East alumni Maar Dinu. This deeply personal film blends digital and analogue techniques, exploring the relationship between the human body and the film’s body, both undergoing processes of transformation to reach their final form. As the film develops, scratches, and reassembles itself, it mirrors the body’s own processes of change, healing, and self-definition. ⚠️ Please note: A Film, My Body contains graphic imagery of body modification performance art. If you prefer to skip the film please arrive for 7.30pm. A Film, My Body dir. Maar Dinu  | 23 min | 2025\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Queerkamp by Chris Westendorp &amp; Lucas van der Rhee  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/31110/queerkamp-by-chris-westendorp-lucas-van-der-rhee\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/872633fd-ca9e-47e6-983f-964b80b24914.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Queerkamp by Chris Westendorp & Lucas van der Rhee  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/31110/queerkamp-by-chris-westendorp-lucas-van-der-rhee\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/872633fd-ca9e-47e6-983f-964b80b24914.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Spectra Presents: Queerkamp, a film by Chris Westendorp and Lucas van der Rhee&#128197; Wednesday 12 November&#128342; 7.00pm&#128205; UCL East Community Cinema – One Pool StreetSensitive and deeply observational, Queerkamp offers an intimate glimpse into the world of a queer youth summer camp, where young people spend a week among peers who share similar experiences and questions of identity. With tenderness and courage, the film captures moments of vulnerability, joy and self-discovery as the participants begin to embrace who they are, often for the first time.Through its gentle, empathetic lens, Queerkamp reveals the quiet strength and resilience that emerge in this safe space, celebrating the transformative power of queer community.Queerkamp dir. Chris Westendorp &amp;amp; Lucas van der Rhee | 60 min | 2024Queerkamp will be preceded by the short film A film, My Body by one of our recent UCL East alumni Maar Dinu. This deeply personal film blends digital and analogue techniques, exploring the relationship between the human body and the film’s body, both undergoing processes of transformation to reach their final form. As the film develops, scratches, and reassembles itself, it mirrors the body’s own processes of change, healing, and self-definition. ⚠️ Please note: A Film, My Body contains graphic imagery of body modification performance art. If you prefer to skip the film please arrive for 7.30pm. A Film, My Body dir. Maar Dinu  | 23 min | 2025\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/31110/queerkamp-by-chris-westendorp-lucas-van-der-rhee\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | Queerkamp by Chris Westendorp &amp; Lucas van der Rhee  | Wednesday 12th November 2025 @ UCL East - One Pool Street | FREE | Find event and ticket information for Spectra, Queer Non Fiction Films at UCL East\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navig