9.427,248.791c-0.719,3.338-4.944,4.383-7.14,1.771l-64.693-77.017    L225.473,35.07L179.427,248.791z\" />\r\n                                                    </g>\r\n                                                </g>\r\n                                            </svg></a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Queerkamp by Chris Westendorp & Lucas van der Rhee </h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Spectra Presents: </strong><i><strong>Queerkamp</strong></i><strong>, a film by Chris Westendorp and Lucas van der Rhee</strong></p><p><br>📅 <strong>Wednesday 12 November</strong><br>🕖 <strong>7.00pm</strong><br>📍 <strong>UCL East Community Cinema – One Pool Street</strong></p><p>Sensitive and deeply observational, <i>Queerkamp</i> offers an intimate glimpse into the world of a queer youth summer camp, where young people spend a week among peers who share similar experiences and questions of identity. With tenderness and courage, the film captures moments of vulnerability, joy and self-discovery as the participants begin to embrace who they are, often for the first time.</p><p>Through its gentle, empathetic lens, <i>Queerkamp</i> reveals the quiet strength and resilience that emerge in this safe space, celebrating the transformative power of queer community.</p><p><i><strong>Queerkamp</strong></i><strong> dir. Chris Westendorp &amp; Lucas van der Rhee | 60 min | 2024</strong><br><br>Queerkamp will be preceded by the short film <i>A film, My Body</i> by one of our recent UCL East alumni Maar Dinu. This deeply personal film blends digital and analogue techniques, exploring the relationship between the human body and the film’s body, both undergoing processes of transformation to reach their final form. As the film develops, scratches, and reassembles itself, it mirrors the body’s own processes of change, healing, and self-definition.&nbsp;</p><p>⚠️ <strong>Please note:</strong> <i>A Film, My Body</i> contains <strong>graphic imagery of body modification performance art.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>If you prefer to skip the film please arrive for 7.30pm.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><i><strong>A Film, My Body </strong></i><strong>dir. Maar Dinu &nbsp;| 23 min | 2025</strong></p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents>London Events </a><a href=/hashtag/cinema>Cinema </a><a href=/hashtag/community>Community </a><a href=/hashtag/film>Film </a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"organiser\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">Organised By\r\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 135 7\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -7px; left: 0;\">\r\n                            <path d=\"M134.608 0.000117724C113.27 0.173747 91.9358 0.526433 70.6042 1.05817C55.826 1.43256 41.0566 1.93717 26.2785 2.4255C18.6216 2.68594 10.9647 2.91925 3.30781 3.12544C2.34941 3.2291 1.43068 3.87061 0.673556 4.96482C0.410131 5.33921 -0.520638 7.03209 0.392569 6.99954C14.117 6.6577 27.8503 6.15309 41.5747 5.71359C58.4983 5.16015 75.4131 4.72066 92.3192 4.3951C105.444 4.14551 118.565 3.97188 131.684 3.87422C132.645 3.78272 133.566 3.13359 134.318 2.01856C134.59 1.66045 135.521 -0.01616 134.608 0.000117724Z\" fill=\"#ff5a5f\"></path>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                        </h4>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"organiserblock\">\r\n                        <div class=\"organiser-center\">\r\n\r\n                            \r\n                            <div class=\"left-half\">\r\n                                <img class=\"organiser-logo\" height=\"142\" width=\"200\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/logo/fce5a2a4-9745-4c30-b16e-60b8e3b7daa0.png\" alt=\"Spectra, Queer Non Fiction Films at UCL East\" />\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"right-half\">\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"organiser-name\">\r\n                                    Spectra, Queer Non Fiction Films at UCL East\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <p class=\"organiser-event\">Organiser of Queerkamp by Chris Westendorp & Lucas van der Rhee </p>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"organiser-link\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"/organiser/spectra-queer-non-fiction-films-at-ucl-east\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"organiser-b