            "size": 216970,
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tThe Golden Spurtle screening + porridge championship! Tickets | 13 Nov @ Good Shepherd Studios, London | £7 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/48b1003e3f996725d29958c6407c7628d895b6c59423ce86809d490268602a4108a2f455d42039841e6a37763c49dbae39bb99ea85f2d7ab12be682be45831a8/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2025-10-24\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Waltham Forest Cinema Project and Good Shepherd Studios presents a night of film and serious porridge making in Leytonstone. Porridge. A simple bowl of oats, but for many a daily staple and the stuff that life is built on. Every year, the tiny town of Carrbridge in Scotland puts porridge in the spotlight for the Golden Spurtle competition, crowning one contestant as the world’s best porridge maker. This beautiful documentary finds that the ways people make porridge are as wild and unique as the people doing the making.Join us for this screening where 2023 Golden Spurtle winner Adam Kiani and Forridge co-founder James Leach will join us to judge Waltham Forest’s best oats. We have a limited number of tickets for those who want to sample the best porridge from Waltham Forest and help crown the borough&#39;s best porridge maker, along with a world champion.Please note: We will be screening the film with descriptive subtitles for added accessibility.6:30PM – Doors 7PM – Screening 8:15PM – 9PM Q&amp;amp;A with 2023 Golden Spurtle winner Adam Kiani and James Leach, with judging of Waltham Forest&#39;s Best Porridge maker.Screening tickets: &#163;7 • Screening + porridge tasting &#163;12Directed by Constantine CostiFilm run time 75 minsTRAILER\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Golden Spurtle screening + porridge championship! Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30137/the-golden-spurtle-screening-porridge-championship\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/60e041c4-9a1f-47e6-83a8-23fff3299566.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Golden Spurtle screening + porridge championship! Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30137/the-golden-spurtle-screening-porridge-championship\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/60e041c4-9a1f-47e6-83a8-23fff3299566.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Waltham Forest Cinema Project and Good Shepherd Studios presents a night of film and serious porridge making in Leytonstone. Porridge. A simple bowl of oats, but for many a daily staple and the stuff that life is built on. Every year, the tiny town of Carrbridge in Scotland puts porridge in the spotlight for the Golden Spurtle competition, crowning one contestant as the world’s best porridge maker. This beautiful documentary finds that the ways people make porridge are as wild and unique as the people doing the making.Join us for this screening where 2023 Golden Spurtle winner Adam Kiani and Forridge co-founder James Leach will join us to judge Waltham Forest’s best oats. We have a limited number of tickets for those who want to sample the best porridge from Waltham Forest and help crown the borough&#39;s best porridge maker, along with a world champion.Please note: We will be screening the film with descriptive subtitles for added accessibility.6:30PM – Doors 7PM – Screening 8:15PM – 9PM Q&amp;amp;A with 2023 Golden Spurtle winner Adam Kiani and James Leach, with judging of Waltham Forest&#39;s Best Porridge maker.Screening tickets: &#163;7 • Screening + porridge tasting &#163;12Directed by Constantine CostiFilm run time 75 minsTRAILER\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/30137/the-golden-spurtle-screening-porridge-championship\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | The Golden Spurtle screening + porridge championship! | Thursday 13th November 2025 @ Good Shepherd Studios | £7 | Find event and ticket information for Waltham Forest Cinema Project\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which alw